  "body": "If easy living is high on your wish list, this one gets it right. Freshly updated and beautifully presented on a generous 660sqm freehold section, 3a Blue Heron Rise gives you all the space of a family home without the weekend workload. With the reserve and green space right next door, there's plenty of extra room for the kids to enjoy, plus you can walk straight through to the playground - all without having to worry about maintaining it yourself.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Split-level brick and tile home\r\n* Three double bedrooms plus an office\r\n* Two living areas \r\n* 660sqm freehold section\r\n* Fresh paint, new double blinds, and new carpet\r\n* Kitchen facelift with a fresh, modern feel\r\n* 5x Heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n* Private deck for outdoor living\r\n* Beautifully landscaped, low-maintenance gardens\r\n* Reserve and walk through to playground directly beside the property\r\n* Daycare centre conveniently located next door \r\n* Close to excellent local schools and beaches\r\n\r\nThe location makes everyday family life wonderfully easy. It's a practical, well-connected spot where the kids can enjoy more freedom and you can spend less time in the garden and more time enjoying your home. Come and see why this one makes easy living look so good - I look forward to showing you through.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: Closes Wednesday 18th November at 4:00pm (unless sold prior) \r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/Z6HJ\r\n\r\nFlexible settlement terms available.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.",
